{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row mt-5">
            <div class="col bg-darkblue rounded-5">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-4 text-white weather-background-image">
                        <div class="row m-4">
                            <div class="col">
                                <p class="fs-1 mb-0">Pijnacker</p>
                                <p class="fs-4 mb-0">18 november 2024</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row mx-4 text-center">
                            <div class="col">
                                <p class="fs-h-1">10&deg;</p>
                                <p class="fs-1">Zwaar bewolkt</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-8 bg-lighterblue rounded-5">
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col m-4">
                                <p class="fs-2">Koud met winterse buien</p>
                                <p>We hebben te maken met koud en guur weer. Daarbij vallen er ook winterse buien met kans op hagel of natte sneeuw. Tijdens intensieve neerslag kan het kortstondig glad worden. In het weekend volgt een zeer snelle weersomslag naar zeer zachte lucht. Is het op zaterdag nog 5 graden, op zondag word het 15 graden. Lokaal is 17 of 18 graden zelfs niet uitgesloten. Daarna wordt het iets minder zacht, maar voorlopig is het weer even gedaan met de winterse neerslag.</p>
                                <div class="bg-white rounded-5">
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between text-black-50 px-4 pt-4">
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>Nu</span>
                                            <span class="fs-4">6&deg;</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>11:00</span>
                                            <span class="fs-4">7&deg;</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>12:00</span>
                                            <span class="fs-4">8&deg;</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>13:00</span>
                                            <span class="fs-4">8&deg;</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>14:00</span>
                                            <span class="fs-4">9&deg;</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div style="height: 200px">
                                        <canvas id="myChart" class="px-4 py-2"></canvas>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between text-black-50 px-4 pb-4">
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>1mm</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>2mm</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>0mm</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>0mm</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center data-point">
                                            <span>2mm</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <p class="mt-4">Details</p>
                                <div class="row text-center">
                                    <div class="col-4">
                                        <div class="bg-white rounded-4 h-100 p-3">
                                            <p class="fs-4 mb-0">Gevoelstemperatuur</p>
                                            <p class="fs-5 fw-bold">8&deg;</p>
                                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between text-black-50">
                                                <span>0&deg;</span>
                                                <span>10&deg;</span>
                                                <span>20&deg;</span>
                                                <span>30&deg;</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="progress">
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-blue" role="progressbar" style="width: 25%;" aria-valuenow="25" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"></div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-4">
                                        <div class="bg-white rounded-4 h-100 p-3">
                                            <p class="fs-4 mb-0">Windkracht</p>
                                            <div id="wind-gauge" class="gauge-container mx-3"></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-4">
                                        <div class="bg-white rounded-4 h-100 p-3">
                                            <p class="fs-4 mb-0">Regen</p>
                                            <p class="fs-5 fw-bold">2mm/h</p>
                                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-around text-black-50">
                                                <span>1</span>
                                                <span>2</span>
                                                <span>3</span>
                                                <span>4</span>
                                                <span>5</span>
                                                <span>6</span>
                                                <span>7</span>
                                                <span>8</span>
                                                <span>9</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="progress bg-transparent">
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-blue" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-blue" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-transparent" role="progressbar" style="width: 3.5%"></div>
                                                <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-gray" role="progressbar" style="width: 8%"></div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mt-4">
                                    <div class="col-4">
                                        <img class="img-fluid rounded-5" src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="placeholder">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-4">
                                        <img class="img-fluid rounded-5" src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="placeholder">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-4">
                                        <img class="img-fluid rounded-5" src="https://placehold.co/600x400" alt="placeholder">
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}